---
import PolicyLayout from "../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro";
---

<PolicyLayout
  title="Cookies Policy | ATL TV Mount"
  description="Cookies Policy for ATL TV Mount, operated by Northline Mounting Services LLC."
>
  <p class="policy-kicker">Legal</p>
  <h1>Cookies Policy</h1>
  <p class="policy-updated">Last updated: September 22, 2026</p>

  <div class="policy-content">
    <p>
      This Cookies Policy explains how
      <strong>ATL TV Mount, operated by Northline Mounting Services LLC</strong>
      uses cookies and similar technologies on our website.
    </p>

    <h2>What Cookies Are</h2>

    <p>
      Cookies are small text files or similar technologies that may be stored on or accessed
      from your device when you visit a website.
    </p>

    <p>
      Similar technologies may include local storage, tags, pixels, scripts, and other tools
      used for website functionality, security, analytics, and advertising measurement.
    </p>

    <h2>How We Use Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>

    <p>We may use these technologies for purposes including:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>Essential website functionality</li>
      <li>Security and fraud prevention</li>
      <li>Website performance and diagnostics</li>
      <li>Understanding how visitors use our website</li>
      <li>Measuring advertising and marketing performance</li>
      <li>Improving website usability and service experience</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Essential Technologies</h2>

    <p>
      Some technologies may be necessary for the website to function properly, maintain security,
      remember technical settings, or provide requested features.
    </p>

    <p>
      These technologies may operate regardless of whether optional analytics or advertising
      technologies are enabled.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>

    <p>
      We use Google Analytics to help us understand how visitors interact with our website.
    </p>

    <p>
      Google Analytics may collect information such as pages viewed, approximate location,
      device and browser information, referral sources, and interactions with the website.
    </p>

    <p>
      This information helps us evaluate website performance and improve our services.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising Measurement</h2>

    <p>
      We use Google Ads and related Google technologies to measure advertising performance
      and understand whether advertising leads to meaningful website actions such as inquiries
      or bookings.
    </p>

    <p>
      Google Tag Manager may be used to manage website measurement tags. Google Tag Manager
      itself is primarily a tag-management system and may load or control other measurement
      technologies used on the website.
    </p>

    <h2>Cloudflare</h2>

    <p>
      We use Cloudflare for website infrastructure, performance, reliability, and security.
      Cloudflare may use cookies or similar technologies when necessary to provide security,
      traffic management, and related website services.
    </p>

    <h2>Google and Data Processing</h2>

    <p>
      Google may process information collected through Google services used on our website.
      More information is available at
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        How Google uses information from sites or apps that use our services
      </a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Your Choices</h2>

    <p>
      Most web browsers allow you to control or delete cookies through browser settings.
      Blocking certain cookies may affect website functionality.
    </p>

    <p>
      You may manage certain Google advertising preferences through
      <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Google Ads Settings
      </a>.
    </p>

    <p>
      Google also provides information about opting out of certain Google Analytics data collection
      through its browser tools and privacy controls.
    </p>

    <h2>Consent and Regional Requirements</h2>

    <p>
      Where applicable law or platform requirements require consent before certain optional
      analytics or advertising technologies are used, we may request that consent and apply
      the visitor’s selected preferences.
    </p>

    <p>
      The availability and form of consent controls may vary depending on the visitor’s location
      and applicable requirements.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to This Cookies Policy</h2>

    <p>
      We may update this Cookies Policy from time to time to reflect changes in technology,
      services, legal requirements, or our website practices.
    </p>

    <p>
      The current version will be posted on this page and the “Last updated” date will be revised
      when appropriate.
    </p>

